Fixed. Cleaned up the temp file.

**Bug:** `src/import_merge.ts:7` compared URLs with `===` (case-sensitive). Hostnames are case-insensitive, so `https://example.com/a` and `https://EXAMPLE.com/a` weren't recognized as the same URL.

**Fix:** Added a `sameUrl` helper that parses both URLs with the `URL` API and compares `host` and `pathname` case-insensitively (query string compared as-is). Non-URL strings fall back to a literal `===` comparison.

**Verified:** case-variant URL now merges into one entry with unioned tags `["x","y"]`; a genuinely different URL still appends as a second entry.


